#org @gText_ThreeIsland_WingullBoy
I'm going to train my [GREEN]Wingull[BLUE] in the\n[GREEN]Berry Forest.[BLUE]\pWhen it evolves, I'm going to de-\nstroy the Elite Four with my rain\lteam!

#org @gText_ThreeIsland_Wingull
[BLUE]Wingull!

#org @gText_threeislandguy_Impressive
You've got seriously impressive\nPok\emon with you.

#org @gText_threeislandguy_Thanks
Thank you! Those goons were\nnothing but bad trouble.\pPlease, take this as part\nof my gratitude.

#org @gText_threeislandguy_Noneed
We don't need you people bringing\nyour noise and trouble here!\pWe're asking you to go back to\nKanto!

#org @gText_threeislandguy_Gocry
Hey, go cry somewhere else.\nOur boss is on his way.\pWhen he gets here, we'll give you\na k-rad motorbike show you won't\lsoon forget!

#org @gText_threeislandguy_GetOut
W-what!? Not on your life!\nGet off the island now!

#org @gText_threeislandguy_WhoGonnaMakeMe
Who's gonna make me?

#org @gText_ThreeIsland_Gatekeeper1
[BLUE]Hello there trainer.\n[GREEN]Berry Forest[BLUE] is an interesting\lchallenge for trainers that are\llooking for some practice.\pIt's a small maze of sorts with\npotent foes.\pThere may be a prize at the end.\nOr maybe not.\pAre you interested?

#org @gText_BerryForest_GateKeeperRules
[BLUE]Your Start menu and other functions\nhave been disabled. So, you won't\lbe able to heal.\pThere are various trainers here\nthat will open up paths if you\ldefeat them.\pI'll be here if you want me to\nescort you out.\pBest of luck.

#org @gText_BerryForest_GateKeeperEscort
Would you like me to escort you\nout?

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer1_1
Ah, someone finally found me!\pYou know, it's said a Legendary Pok\e-\nmon is known to roam this forest,\lbut I've been working here for quite\lsome time and have never seen\lsuch a thing at all.\pAnywho, you ready to fight?

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer1_2
I'm gonna give it my all!

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer1_3
It's never enough eh[.]

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer1_4
I can heal two Pok\emon.\nShall I heal the first?

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer1_4_2
[BLUE]Your [GREEN][BUFFER1][BLUE] has been healed.

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer1_4_3
Shall I heal the second?

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer1_5
Hm[.] Well, suit yourself.

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer1_6
I've opened up a path for you.\pHave fun trainer.

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer2_1
Carnivine-S is a useful Pok\emon,\nespecially when compared to its\llackluster Sinnoh form.\pYou can find plenty of those\nin this forest.\pOf course, you can't encounter Pok\e-\nmon until your bag is enabled\lagain.\pWell, are you ready to face\noff, trainer?

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer2_2
Okay, let's go!

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer2_3
Sheesh[.]

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer2_4
Okay well, I can heal two\nPok\emon. Shall I heal the first?

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer2_4_2
[RED]Your [GREEN][BUFFER1][RED] has been healed.

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer2_4_3
Do you want me to heal another?

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer2_5
Well, okay then.

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer2_6
Another path has been opened.\nHave fun.

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer3_1
Traditionally, Fire Red doesn't keep\ntrack of time, so the hidden berries in this\lforest regenerate after 1500 steps.\pOf course, that's been changed\nin Radical Red, but the original\lfunctionality still remains.\pAnyway, would you like to begin?

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer3_2
Whoo, I'm pumped up!

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer3_3
Too easy eh[.]

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer3_4
As usual, I can heal two Pok\emon.\pShall I heal the first?

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer3_4_2
[BLUE]Your [GREEN][BUFFER1][BLUE] has been healed.

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer3_4_3
Do you want me to heal another?

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer3_5
Huh, you do you.

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer3_6
I've opened up a path for ya.\nBye bye!

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer4_1
Ah hello! I'm the final hurdle!\pY'know, it's been so long since some-\none's reached the end, I'm not even\lsure anything's present at the\lend.\pBut legends have said a cute pink\nPok\emon awaits[.]\pSounds like a [GREEN]Jigglypuff[RED] eh!\pWouldn't that be disappointing!\nHahaha[.]\pWell, shall we begin, trainer?

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer4_2
Good luck.

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer4_3
Wow, you really want that Jigglypuff!

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer4_4
Okay well, I won't touch your party.\pI doubt they need help against\nthe pink menace.

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer4_4_2
[RED]Your [GREEN][BUFFER1][RED] has been healed.

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer4_4_3
Do you want me to heal another?

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer4_5
Well, okay then.

#org @gText_BerryForest_AceTrainer4_6
I've opened the final path.\pI hope you find something useful.

#org @gText_ThreeIslandLostelle_LostelleOne
[GREEN]Lostelle:[RED] Whimper[.] Sniff[.]\nOh! Please, help!\pI used the walk through walls cheat\nand somehow ended up here.\pNow my games bugged and I can't find\na way out of here!\pThis made [GREEN]Lostelle[RED] scared.\pI'm too scared to move!\nBut I want to go home[.]

#org @gText_ThreeIslandLostelle_LostelleTwo
Oh! Is this a Pok\emon?!\nNo! Go away! It's scaring me!\pWaaaaaaah!\nI want my daddy!

#org @gText_ThreeIslandLostelle_LostelleThree
Ohh! That Pok\emon was cute, actually!\nI shouldn't have been so scared.\pThank you!\p[GREEN]Lostelle[RED] came to pick some\nBerries.\p[.]Oh, you don't need berries?\pWell, you can have this instead.

#org @gText_ThreeIslandLostelle_LostelleFour
What's your name?\p[GREEN]Lostelle's[RED] scared, so can I go\nwith you to my daddy's house?\pOkay!\nLet's go home!

#org @gText_ThreeIsland_CaveGuyDonege
That's Groundium Z.\nI found one of those mining here.\pUnfortunately, I'm not strong enough\nto make use of it.

#org @gText_ThreeIsland_CaveGuy1
Hey, there! How's it going?\nI've struck gold!\pYou can't begin to imagine just\nhow happy I am.\pSo, I'll show you!\nThis is for you!\p[.]Huh? You don't want gold?\pHmm[.] that's a new one.\nPerhaps you'd like this instead.

#org @gText_BerryForest_MewGotAway
The Mew got away[.]

#org @gText_BerryForest_GatekeeperMew
[BLUE]Huh, is that [GREEN]Mewtwo?!

#org @gText_BerryForest_GatekeeperMew_1
[BLUE]It was truly puzzling[.]\pI am the gatekeeper that allowed you\nentry to [GREEN]Berry Forest[BLUE] earlier.\pMy duty has been protecting [GREEN]Mew.[BLUE]\p[GREEN]Mew[BLUE] here was always a kind Pok\e-\nmon, who would travel far and wide\lproviding assistance to strangers in\lneed.\p[GREEN]Berry Forest[BLUE] was its true home,\nwhere it'd stop occasionally to bless\ltrainers with its presence[.]\pHowever, its recent attack on the\npoor [GREEN]Lostelle[BLUE] was truly out of\lcharacter!\pBut, now it makes sense[.]\p[GREEN]Mew[BLUE] has been angsty knowing [GREEN]Mewtwo[BLUE]\nhas awoken in the cave it resided\lin[.]

#org @gText_BerryForest_GatekeeperMewtwo
[GREEN]Mewtwo: [BLUE]I admit, I was once\nan apathetic machine[.]\pBut ever since I've been under\nthe wing of [GREEN][PLAYER][BLUE],\lI've become far less belligerent[.]\pI've come simply so I could\nwitness the power of my original.

#org @gText_BerryForest_GatekeeperMew_2
[BLUE]Mm[.] I've heard tales of your potential\nto communicate.\pIt seems they are true.\pFine, if it's a battle you seek, I will\ndo my best to deliver.\pIt may help [GREEN]Mew[BLUE] loosen up.

#org @gText_BerryForest_GateKeeperMewCry
[RED]Mew!

#org @gText_BerryForest_GatekeeperMew_3
[BLUE]Well then. [GREEN]Mew[BLUE] has spoken.\nLet us begin.

#org @gText_BerryForest_DotDotdot
[.]

#org @gText_BerryForest_Gatekeeper_Loss
Mm[.]\nThat is most impressive.

#org @gText_BerryForest_GatekeeperMew_4
[BLUE]Yes[.]\nFrom this fight, I can attest that\l[GREEN]Mewtwo[BLUE] is under good hands.

#org @gText_BerryForest_GatekeeperMew_5
[BLUE]What do you think, [GREEN]Mew?

#org @gText_BerryForest_GatekeeperMew_6
[BLUE]How interesting[.]\pIt appears [GREEN]Mew[BLUE] would like to\njoin your party.

#org @gText_BerryForest_GatekeeperMew_7
[BLACK]You received a [GREEN]Mew!

#org @gText_BerryForest_GatekeeperMew_7_2
[BLACK]It was holding an item[.]

#org @gText_BerryForest_GatekeeperMew_8
[BLUE]Well, it seems my life-long duty\nhere is finished.\pIt may be time for me to enjoy\nretirement[.]\pWhat a strange day.\nGood bye, [GREEN][PLAYER].\p[BLUE]Please take good care of [GREEN]Mew.

#org @gText_BerryForest_MewtwoPost
[BLUE]Hmm, how peculiar.\nIt seems [GREEN]Mew's [BLUE]stats are significantly\linferior to mine.\pHowever, it has the capability of\nlearning nearly every single technique.\pI wonder how I lost such a skill\nin my birth[.]\pRegardless, I am thankful that you've\ngiven me this opportunity,\l[GREEN][PLAYER].\p[BLUE]I am forever grateful.
